        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Welcome to **Grimlord** - a Dark Fantasy Action Souls-like RPG built on Unreal Engine 5 for VR. Awakened in a monastery deep in the Lonely Mountains, you walk in an epic quest as the adventurer standing before the darkness and striving for the light against the tyrannical Grim Lord.\n\n{575489581620892}\n\nYou’re a prisoner in a monastery somewhere deep in the Lonely Mountains. You are free to choose how to fight your way out. Choose your way of becoming a battling adventurer whilst standing before the darkness.\n\nGrimlord brings combat in VR like never before. With a ton of unique enemies sprawling the monastery grounds capable of showing you their individual combat prowess, you’re left to learn how to deal with them efficiently - for survival’s sake.\n\n{563482963086229}\n\nAre you a battle-hardened sword & shield adventurer or a staff-wielding magic artist? Maybe a long-ranged bow & arrow assassin? How about an agile dual-wielding bladesman? Even go wild as a shield & dagger throwing specialist? The choice is yours, prisoner.\n\n{2086124911804740}\n\nWith boss battles meant to test your accumulated skills and knowledge, each encounter assures every prisoner’s adventure to strive for the light is as unique as it can be.",
